      "title": "UI: Only sort visible packets instead of all packets",
      "message": "UI: Only sort visible packets instead of all packets\n\nPreviously, Wireshark was sorting all packets in a capture,\nregardless whether they were actually visible or not. If you\nare working with large PCAPs & filters, this is a MASSIVE\nperformance drag. Therefore, this commit changes this\nby only sorting the visible packets which boosts the\nsorting performance in filtered views massively.\n",
      "author_name": "Nils Hanke",
      "author_email": "nils.hanke@outlook.de",
      "authored_date": "2022-04-29T13:58:22.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Roland Knall",
      "committer_email": "rknall@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2022-10-31T16:50:11.000+00:00",
